2026-11-09T05:35:41.7004195Z   "limitations": [
2026-11-09T05:35:41.7004730Z     "Conformal interpretation applies only to exchangeable clean initial-state repair paths.",
2026-11-09T05:35:41.7005485Z     "No trajectory-wide or shifted-distribution conformal coverage is claimed.",
2026-11-09T05:35:41.7006738Z     "Exact-decrease acceptance pays online true-objective forward costs and prevents increases by construction; this is not evidence that calibration alone guarantees finite-step safety.",
2026-11-09T05:35:41.7007961Z     "Fixed heuristic budgets are declared in config; these are not matched-cost unless measured total costs match.",
2026-11-09T05:35:41.7008941Z     "Scenarios share seed/case models; uncertainty is computed within scenario over independent generated model pairs.",
2026-11-09T05:35:41.7009834Z     "Timing includes online certification and verification; offline validation uses a separate solver/cache.",
2026-11-09T05:35:41.7010958Z     "This development study does not establish field-scale computational advantage or competition readiness.",
2026-11-09T05:35:41.7012172Z     "The guarded policy detects declared acquisition-support mismatches only; it cannot establish geological exchangeability or detect every kind of OOD shift."
